Package: anc-tactical-suite
Version: 0.1.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libasound2 (>= 1.2.0), libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxrandr2, libxi6
Maintainer: DRDO SIH 26052 Core Team <tactical-anc@drdo.gov.in>
Description: Real-Time Tactical AI Active Noise Cancellation & Spatial Audio Daemon
 Military-grade sub-16ms low-latency DSP suite for dismounted combat communications.
 Features dual-mic MVDR beamforming, AuxIVA blind source separation,
 IEC 60268-16 RASTI/STI speech intelligibility HUD, bone-air sensor fusion,
 ATAK Cursor-on-Target telemetry, and ad-hoc squad mesh networking.
